ike the previous hand the blind and  crippled sir thailand lannister he could  still will the sword the sword's current  whereabouts are unknown the final and  one of the most legendary valyrian steel  swords in westeros that we'll see is  lady forlorn  it's the ancestral longsword of house  corbrey  lady forlorn is traditionally passed  down from lord to lord but examples of  lords lending the blade to a son or a  brother for their lifetime only to have  it returned to the lord afterward have  been recorded in the history of the  house  lady forlorn has a heart-shaped ruby in  its pommel its valyrian steel is smoke  grey in appearance  the name lady forlorn is a legacy from  the coming of the andals  and predates the current sword  robar the second royce the high king of  the first men of the vale  claimed the first lady forlorn after  slaying kwail corbray the king of the  fingers and the andal leader  robar wielded lady forlorn during the  battle the seven stars  using it to kill tor gold toilet and a  decoy dressed as sir are the serene the  coral braves claimed that sir jamie  corbrey slew robar in the battle  allowing them to reclaim the first lady  forlorn  at some point the coral brace acquired  the valyrian steel sword which they  named lady forlorn in honor of the  ancient sword sir corbin corbray the  brother of lord lillian corbrey wields  lady forlorn during the dance of the  dragons corbin one of the regions for  aegon iii it's laid by a crossbowman at  runestone after drawing lady forlorn on  lord ganthur royce those are all the  valyrian steel swords that we'll see in  the house of the dragon the most  legendary of them ice blackfyre and dark  sister you'll see in season 1 with  others coming and going throughout the  series  the game of thrones prequel series house  of the dragon based on the book fire and  blood velar in 2022 on hbo thank you so  much for watching if you enjoyed this  video please give it a big thumbs up and  i hope to see you in t